WEBVTT

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:06.360
<b>Shibaki</b>

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.360
Ruru-chan!

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:07.820
What?

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:11.720
What are you doing?

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:12.400
Cleaning.

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:17.750
At least, I was trying to 
until I tripped on the bucket.

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:19.160
<b>Splash</b>

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:18.740
I'm sorry.

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:22.000
<b>Soak</b>

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:26.750
<b>Drip
 Drip</b>

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:27.820
Oh?

00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:30.250
It's wet over here, too.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:30.900
Oh?

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:32.850
It's wet over here, too.

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:35.080
Oh? It's wet over here, too...

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.890
<i>She's never going to finish...</i>

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:37.220
<i>Oh, boy...</i>

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:42.980
An errand?

00:00:43.390 --> 00:00:46.480
Yes. I want you to take something to Kota.

00:00:47.110 --> 00:00:49.940
Kota went to his grandmother's 
house to help her, remember?

00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:52.400
I just got a call...

00:00:53.410 --> 00:00:56.780
<i>Yeah, I kinda forgot something...</i>

00:00:57.130 --> 00:01:01.880
Seitaro is out, and I'm about to go to work.

00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:02.700
Can you do it?

00:01:03.190 --> 00:01:04.620
Perfect timing.

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:08.170
I don't have work on Sunday, 
and I didn't know what to do.

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:10.130
Leave it to me.

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:12.050
Change out of those clothes, okay?

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:16.880
You have your map for after 
you get off the train, right?

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:17.990
Yes.

00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:19.710
If you get lost,

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:22.970
either call Grandma or ask at a police box.

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:23.850
Okay.

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:26.520
Do you have the package?

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:29.320
You worry too much, Mama-san.

00:01:29.760 --> 00:01:31.970
I put the package in my bag.

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:33.400
<b>Map</b>

00:01:31.970 --> 00:01:33.790
I have a map of the area.

00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:36.920
I haven't even forgotten the water 
you told me to take because

00:01:36.920 --> 00:01:38.280
I'll be walking around in the heat.

00:01:38.720 --> 00:01:42.160
To get on the train, I just need 
to buy a stamp, correct?

00:01:43.480 --> 00:01:44.620
I'm off.

00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:48.080
<b>Stamp</b>

00:01:45.470 --> 00:01:47.580
<i>Is this her first time doing such a basic thing?</i>

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:49.280
It's not a stamp!

00:01:49.130 --> 00:01:50.540
<b>Ticket</b>

00:01:49.280 --> 00:01:50.540
It's a ticket! A ticket!

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:53.300
A ticket!

00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:28.010
Ticket. Ticket.

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:31.720
First Errand

00:03:28.410 --> 00:03:31.890
Ticket. Ticket.

00:03:32.450 --> 00:03:35.970
Ticket. Ticket.

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:37.820
That girl...

00:03:38.240 --> 00:03:40.480
She works in the cafeteria.

00:03:40.480 --> 00:03:44.200
Isn't she hot in those clothes?

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:49.200
Ticket, ticket, ticket, ticket...

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:53.870
Ticket, ticket, ticket, ticket...

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:55.880
Ticket, ticket...

00:03:56.360 --> 00:03:58.080
Ticket, ticket, ticket, ticket, ticket...

00:03:58.080 --> 00:04:00.000
T-Ticket...

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:00.970
Hi-yah!

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:05.350
What are ya doing?

00:04:06.820 --> 00:04:07.810
Now!

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:10.770
Ticket, ticket, ticket!

00:04:14.740 --> 00:04:16.190
Are you okay?

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:18.740
Thank you.

00:04:19.430 --> 00:04:21.040
Are you on your way somewhere?

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:22.190
I'm going to work.

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:26.000
Is the cafeteria open on Sunday?

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:26.990
T—

00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:27.600
T?

00:04:28.020 --> 00:04:28.620
T—

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:31.090
Tell me where they sell stamps.

00:04:31.090 --> 00:04:32.270
Stamps?

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:34.440
You can get them at the convenience store,

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:36.940
but the post office has a wider variety.

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:38.340
Sakurai-kun!

00:04:39.280 --> 00:04:40.880
One second.

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.760
Sorry, I've gotta go.

00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:46.260
Let's go on a date sometime, Ruru-san.

00:04:46.610 --> 00:04:47.300
Bye.

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:50.760
He took advantage of the 
confusion to hold her hand.

00:04:52.280 --> 00:04:53.270
Who was that?

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:55.770
Stamp.

00:04:56.340 --> 00:04:57.810
Stamp...

00:04:58.320 --> 00:05:00.040
Stamp...

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:02.380
Stamp...

00:05:02.800 --> 00:05:03.610
What'sa matter?

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:05.930
Where's the post office?

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:07.350
Ya don't know?

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:13.510
I don't know.

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:16.580
I'm gonna go look around for it.

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:18.120
Thanks.

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:20.750
Mailbox, mailbox.

00:05:23.830 --> 00:05:26.010
So this is a mailbox?

00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:30.800
Ruru-san!

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:33.520
Rurumo!

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:36.270
I found this thing's boss.

00:05:37.990 --> 00:05:40.250
Stamp, 540 yen.

00:05:42.700 --> 00:05:44.810
Okay, that's 540 yen worth of stamps.

00:05:44.810 --> 00:05:46.480
Thank you.

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:50.660
<b>Postal Savings</b>

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:50.660
<b>Anglerfish Savings</b>

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:49.200
The tissues are free.

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:50.220
Thank you.

00:05:51.190 --> 00:05:53.640
Now that ya got yer stamps, 
the next stop is the station.

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:55.660
I know where the station is. It's this way.

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:58.860
Didn't we just go this way?

00:05:58.860 --> 00:06:01.300
This town has many similar-looking houses.

00:06:01.930 --> 00:06:02.840
Probably.

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:05.670
Didn't we just go this way, too?

00:06:05.910 --> 00:06:08.520
This town likes having similar-looking houses.

00:06:09.230 --> 00:06:09.950
Probably.

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:11.430
Probably.

00:06:11.810 --> 00:06:14.210
Pro... ba... bly.

00:06:14.530 --> 00:06:15.040
Probably.

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:15.680
Probably.

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:16.300
Probably.

00:06:16.420 --> 00:06:16.930
Probably.

00:06:17.090 --> 00:06:17.680
Probably.

00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:20.650
Pro... ba... bly.

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:27.200
Okay, I'm going to ask you again,

00:06:27.200 --> 00:06:28.740
so tell me the truth this time.

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:29.890
Okay.

00:06:29.890 --> 00:06:31.420
Will you tell me your name, age,

00:06:31.420 --> 00:06:34.830
and what you are doing here?

00:06:35.300 --> 00:06:39.740
I lost my prefix when I was demoted,
 so now I am Rurumo.

00:06:39.740 --> 00:06:41.220
I am 315 years old.

00:06:41.220 --> 00:06:42.520
I am a trainee witch.

00:06:42.520 --> 00:06:45.550
I am training on Earth to 
regain my status as a witch.

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:51.640
Th-The residents reported someone 
strange wandering around.

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:55.600
What were you trying to do,
 dressed like that?

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:58.120
Stop teasing, and tell me the truth.

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:00.560
<i>Listen, Rurumo.</i>

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:06.530
<b>Menacing</b>

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:03.290
<i>Here on Earth,</i>

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:06.530
<i>there's a magic word that will solve all problems.</i>

00:07:06.950 --> 00:07:07.900
<i>It is...</i>

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:10.710
I'm cosplaying.

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:15.000
<b>Nishimachi Avenue Shopping District</b>

00:07:12.330 --> 00:07:16.010
That busty chick turned out 
to be pretty considerate.

00:07:16.010 --> 00:07:18.330
She even told ya the way to the station.

00:07:18.840 --> 00:07:20.640
She solved the mystery of the map, too.

00:07:20.640 --> 00:07:23.150
Ya just didn't know how to read it.

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:28.560
That's the student monitor who 
chased the idiot and me around.

00:07:28.560 --> 00:07:30.730
Ah, the one who's gentler than the sky.

00:07:30.730 --> 00:07:31.800
What's that mean?

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:39.020
<b>Cosplay Store 
Anime Star</b>

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:37.090
Y-You... You're Shibaki's...

00:07:39.670 --> 00:07:40.710
<i>This isn't good.</i>

00:07:40.710 --> 00:07:43.980
<i>If she learns a student monitor enjoys cosplay...</i>

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:52.950
<b>Tattle 
Tattle</b>

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:52.950
Tattle, tattle, tattle, tattle...

00:07:44.600 --> 00:07:47.400
What? She was coming out of a cosplay shop?

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:49.220
Hey, hey! She's a student monitor.

00:07:49.220 --> 00:07:52.950
She strictly prohibits dressing up,
 yet she's a cosplayer?

00:07:53.380 --> 00:07:55.740
I'll tell the whole school.

00:08:04.260 --> 00:08:06.590
<i>That might not be so bad...</i>

00:08:07.070 --> 00:08:09.100
<i>No, there's no way that could be true!</i>

00:08:09.100 --> 00:08:11.800
<i>Cosplayers are lonely people 
that nobody understands!</i>

00:08:12.110 --> 00:08:12.890
<i>This isn't good!</i>

00:08:12.890 --> 00:08:15.430
<i>If I can't play this off, 
this will be really bad!</i>

00:08:17.370 --> 00:08:19.970
D-Don't tell anyone about this...

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:21.250
Huh?

00:08:24.030 --> 00:08:26.160
She's a cosplayer, too...

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:28.900
So she pretended not to see me?

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:31.580
We used up a lotta time.

00:08:32.900 --> 00:08:33.860
Let's hurry.

00:08:36.190 --> 00:08:38.860
I'm getting on. Here's a 540 yen stamp.

00:08:38.860 --> 00:08:40.830
You can't ride with this, miss.

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:43.160
<b>Shock</b>

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:43.180
Why not?

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:47.350
Why not? Because no one rides with these.

00:08:48.600 --> 00:08:51.550
<i>It's 540 yen to Kuwayama Station.</i>

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:53.310
<i>540 yen!</i>

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:54.590
That's odd.

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:56.360
Did they raise the price?

00:08:56.360 --> 00:08:58.690
That's not the problem...

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:01.460
We're gonna...

00:09:01.460 --> 00:09:03.510
...be late!

00:09:04.780 --> 00:09:05.850
I see.

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:08.560
<b>Slide</b>

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:07.720
I put them in here...

00:09:07.720 --> 00:09:08.560
Hey!

00:09:08.960 --> 00:09:10.680
A prank can only go so far!

00:09:10.680 --> 00:09:11.870
Come with me!

00:09:11.870 --> 00:09:13.560
And what's with that ridiculous outfit?

00:09:13.560 --> 00:09:16.280
Let go! I have an important job to do!

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:19.630
<i>I won't be able to deliver the package.</i>

00:09:19.630 --> 00:09:21.790
<i>I won't complete my job...</i>

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:23.000
Huh?

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:24.960
Ruru-san!

00:09:26.380 --> 00:09:29.530
Thank you for paying for me.

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:31.380
<b>Basketballer</b>

00:09:29.530 --> 00:09:31.380
It was no problem.

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:36.360
<i>I seem to have saved her from a bind.
And standing side by side like this...</i>

00:09:36.360 --> 00:09:38.840
<i>We totally look like a couple, don't we?</i>

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:43.480
<i>Look! That old dude totally thinks we are!</i>

00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:45.560
<b>What a 
weird 
outfit...</b>

00:09:43.970 --> 00:09:45.090
By the way...

00:09:45.090 --> 00:09:45.950
Yes?

00:09:45.950 --> 00:09:47.060
Who are you?

00:09:47.360 --> 00:09:48.830
Huh? Um...

00:09:49.220 --> 00:09:50.350
I'm Shiba's friend...

00:09:50.350 --> 00:09:54.090
I mean, I'm Shibaki-kun's friend Sugawara...

00:09:54.090 --> 00:09:57.030
Oh. His friend Sugawara.

00:09:57.720 --> 00:09:59.030
I've never heard that name before.

00:09:59.110 --> 00:10:04.160
<b>Crushed</b>

00:10:03.010 --> 00:10:04.160
Come to think of it...

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:05.790
Did you remember?

00:10:08.090 --> 00:10:09.760
<i>She's thinking! She's thinking hard!</i>

00:10:09.760 --> 00:10:11.790
<i>I've been totally shut out from her memories!</i>

00:10:12.240 --> 00:10:14.720
<i>But she's cute, so it's okay.</i>

00:10:14.720 --> 00:10:19.660
<i>Anyway, I can't believe a girl 
this cute is Shiba's sister...</i>

00:10:19.660 --> 00:10:22.260
<i>All right! I'm gonna use today 
to get closer to her!</i>

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:24.550
B-By the way,

00:10:24.550 --> 00:10:27.610
something really interesting 
happened in my club the other day.

00:10:27.610 --> 00:10:28.890
You wanna hear about it?

00:10:28.890 --> 00:10:29.730
Not really.

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:34.690
<b>Crushed</b>

00:10:33.770 --> 00:10:34.690
Maybe a little.

00:10:35.420 --> 00:10:37.890
Seriously? Thank you!

00:10:38.690 --> 00:10:43.620
See, I went with some of my senpai to 
buy drinks from the vending machine.

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:46.020
But then...

00:10:46.020 --> 00:10:47.670
Kuwayama, Kuwayama.

00:10:47.670 --> 00:10:48.360
Bye.

00:10:48.360 --> 00:10:51.080
The doors are closing. Please be careful.

00:10:57.560 --> 00:11:00.270
Um, that friend...

00:11:00.270 --> 00:11:03.510
Uh... Sugayama, right?

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:03.510
<b>Suga . . .</b>

00:11:04.210 --> 00:11:05.540
I'll remember that.

00:11:08.640 --> 00:11:10.640
What a huge mountain.

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:11.400
Now, then...

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:13.900
Here

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:13.900
Signal 
Right

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:13.900
Kuwayama 
Station

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:13.900
Turn Left

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:13.900
River

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:13.900
Which way do I go?

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:21.860
<b>Tilt</b>

00:11:22.670 --> 00:11:23.570
I see.

00:11:23.920 --> 00:11:25.020
This way.

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:27.080
<b>Wrong</b>

00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:29.080
What a nice place.

00:11:29.520 --> 00:11:31.080
There's lots of greenery.

00:11:31.490 --> 00:11:33.080
Tha air's nice and clean, too.

00:11:33.510 --> 00:11:35.290
There's nature everywhere.

00:11:37.440 --> 00:11:38.640
That's odd...

00:11:38.640 --> 00:11:39.940
What is?

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:43.970
Here

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:43.970
Signal 
Right

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:43.970
Kawayama 
Station

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:43.970
Turn Left

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:43.970
River

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:42.610
There's no signal.

00:11:44.520 --> 00:11:46.720
No signal.

00:11:47.480 --> 00:11:48.600
Rurumo.

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:49.140
What?

00:11:49.960 --> 00:11:52.910
You've been headin' completely 
the wrong way from the start.

00:11:52.910 --> 00:11:53.680
What?

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:54.860
<b>Here</b>

00:11:55.250 --> 00:11:57.500
We should turn back.

00:11:57.500 --> 00:11:58.610
I'm sorry.

00:12:04.360 --> 00:12:06.990
I can't complete my job without that!

00:12:10.870 --> 00:12:13.360
It got stuck somewhere real visible.

00:12:13.360 --> 00:12:14.290
I'll go get it.

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:15.650
Be careful.

00:12:15.650 --> 00:12:16.700
Got it.

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:22.130
<b>Silence</b>

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:24.090
Rurumo disappeared!

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:24.090
<b>Shock</b>

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:30.980
It's so big!

00:12:30.980 --> 00:12:32.420
But, you know...

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:35.020
<b>Cousin</b>

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:35.020
<b>Cousin's 
Friend</b>

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:35.020
<b>Yuki-chan</b>

00:12:32.420 --> 00:12:35.020
<i>Yuki-chan sure is cute.</i>

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:39.610
<i>Once I get that, I'll advance to a higher stage!</i>

00:12:39.880 --> 00:12:42.510
<i>I hope she gets here with it soon.</i>

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:48.990
<b><i>Rurumo!!</i></b>

00:12:57.800 --> 00:12:59.120
I'm not injured.

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:25.340
The sun is starting to go down.

00:13:25.340 --> 00:13:26.670
I must hurry.

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:30.990
Rurumo!

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:33.950
If you can hear me, answer!

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:36.870
Rurumo!

00:13:38.620 --> 00:13:39.790
Rurumo!

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:44.670
I got no choice!

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:47.630
<b>Rustle Rustle</b>

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:50.100
<b>Rustle Rustle</b>

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:51.260
<b>Rustle Rustle</b>

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:54.060
The plants are laughing.

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:57.020
Is it really that funny?

00:14:16.480 --> 00:14:19.580
According to the map, it should be this way!

00:14:20.060 --> 00:14:22.230
It's the house up here!

00:14:23.600 --> 00:14:24.960
This is good.

00:14:25.490 --> 00:14:27.670
Once we're done eating, 
we should get back to work.

00:14:27.950 --> 00:14:28.780
Yeah.

00:14:31.840 --> 00:14:35.360
<i>Just looking at Yuki-chan eases my soul...</i>

00:14:37.280 --> 00:14:39.680
How cute. Here, kitty.

00:14:39.680 --> 00:14:40.350
<i>Huh?!</i>

00:14:41.550 --> 00:14:43.150
Yeah, it is cute.

00:14:43.150 --> 00:14:45.110
Doesn't look familiar, though.

00:14:46.410 --> 00:14:48.860
Are you lost, kitty?

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:52.870
Why are ya actin' all moonstruck? It's disgraceful.

00:14:53.230 --> 00:14:56.380
Isn't my cousin's friend Yuki-chan cute?

00:14:56.380 --> 00:14:59.080
She came to help pick corn.

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:00.660
She's in her third year of middle school.

00:15:00.660 --> 00:15:02.150
Pretty high level, huh?

00:15:02.150 --> 00:15:03.000
I don't care about that.

00:15:03.430 --> 00:15:05.710
So, did you bring it?

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:08.380
I'm not a delivery service!

00:15:08.680 --> 00:15:10.900
It's a long way to get here, isn't it?

00:15:10.900 --> 00:15:13.670
I'll feed you lots of corn later to thank you

00:15:13.670 --> 00:15:16.790
for bringing my goods to 
become popular with the ladies.

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:18.100
Popular with the ladies?

00:15:18.420 --> 00:15:20.600
Necessities to advance to a higher stage.

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:25.610
<b>Artisan</b>

00:15:20.920 --> 00:15:23.630
Those artisan smart phone cases I picked out

00:15:23.630 --> 00:15:25.610
are sure to be popular with girls!

00:15:25.820 --> 00:15:28.490
That's what was in that bag?

00:15:28.490 --> 00:15:31.070
I didn't think you'd be the one to bring them.

00:15:31.650 --> 00:15:32.780
Good work!

00:15:34.760 --> 00:15:36.200
Rurumo's got it.

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:38.890
Where's Rurumo?

00:15:38.890 --> 00:15:39.750
She's lost!

00:15:42.210 --> 00:15:44.210
<b>Rustle Rustle</b>

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:46.210
<b>Rustle Rustle</b>

00:15:46.740 --> 00:15:47.890
<i>I see.</i>

00:15:48.290 --> 00:15:50.880
<i>They touched my hat and cape...</i>

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:54.840
<i>These have a healing spell cast on them.</i>

00:15:56.060 --> 00:15:58.920
<i>In time, they'll wilt and fall off.</i>

00:16:00.010 --> 00:16:01.560
<i>Don't worry.</i>

00:16:01.950 --> 00:16:03.480
<i>This happens all the time.</i>

00:16:05.010 --> 00:16:06.310
<i>It happens...</i>

00:16:06.770 --> 00:16:07.780
<i>all the time...</i>

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:19.570
<i>It's pretty noisy when insects 
gather around it, though.</i>

00:16:20.480 --> 00:16:21.450
<i>And...</i>

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:24.410
<i>It's heavy.</i>

00:16:25.720 --> 00:16:28.130
How did she get lost with you accompanying her?

00:16:28.450 --> 00:16:33.470
She was just tryin' her best to 
do yer stupid job, moron!

00:16:34.530 --> 00:16:36.760
<i>Could this perhaps be...</i>

00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:40.720
<i>quite bad?</i>

00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:45.790
<i>At this rate, I'll end up merging with the plants.</i>

00:16:46.490 --> 00:16:47.230
<i>But first,</i>

00:16:47.780 --> 00:16:49.440
<i>I need to get that.</i>

00:16:51.000 --> 00:16:55.030
<i>I don't care what happens to me...</i>

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:03.760
She's on the other side of that hill!

00:17:03.760 --> 00:17:05.120
Rurumo!

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:08.130
Ruru—

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:08.880
What is that?

00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:14.720
A hat forest?

00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:15.910
Rurumo!

00:17:15.910 --> 00:17:18.600
You can't mean... That's Rurumo?

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:20.010
She's merged with them!

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:22.220
Merged? What does that mean?

00:17:22.920 --> 00:17:27.320
Rurumo's hat and cape have a 
healing spell cast on them.

00:17:27.320 --> 00:17:32.010
The spell must've caused a chain reaction 
on all the plants she touched,

00:17:32.010 --> 00:17:34.690
and caught her in a spiral of propagation.

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:36.760
I don't really get it.

00:17:36.760 --> 00:17:40.360
Are you saying Rurumo's 
going to turn into a plant?

00:17:40.360 --> 00:17:41.670
Most likely.

00:17:41.670 --> 00:17:45.160
Oh, come on! How did this happen 
with you accompanying her?

00:17:45.340 --> 00:17:48.110
What was I supposed to do about it?

00:17:46.950 --> 00:17:48.110
Don't cry!

00:17:48.110 --> 00:17:50.230
I'll use the tickets to...

00:17:50.230 --> 00:17:52.960
It's too big. It may not work.

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:55.380
What? It doesn't work if it's too big?

00:17:56.630 --> 00:17:59.140
Then... how do we...

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:07.270
Perfect timing.

00:18:07.590 --> 00:18:09.230
Rurumo!

00:18:10.170 --> 00:18:11.260
Kota...

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:17.030
Rurumo!

00:18:21.480 --> 00:18:23.240
She took off her witch clothes!

00:18:23.280 --> 00:18:23.790
<b>Roll</b>

00:18:23.790 --> 00:18:24.240
<b>Roll</b>

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:24.700
<b>Roll</b>

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:25.200
<b>Roll</b>

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:25.680
<b>Roll</b>

00:18:26.280 --> 00:18:27.460
Rurumo!

00:18:27.720 --> 00:18:29.050
Are you okay?

00:18:29.050 --> 00:18:30.150
I...

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:32.250
I'm fine.

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:34.170
You don't look fine!

00:18:35.120 --> 00:18:38.590
You worry too much, too.

00:18:38.980 --> 00:18:41.140
You're a mess...

00:18:41.500 --> 00:18:42.940
Don't worry.

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:46.460
Look, your package.

00:18:46.460 --> 00:18:49.110
It was stuck in a tree,

00:18:49.110 --> 00:18:51.740
but I got it before I couldn't move anymore.

00:18:54.710 --> 00:18:57.360
You're unbelievable.

00:18:59.780 --> 00:19:02.370
I did my job.

00:19:07.680 --> 00:19:10.490
This is nothin' like the bath in yer mom's house.

00:19:10.490 --> 00:19:11.920
How's the water?

00:19:12.420 --> 00:19:13.560
Perfect.

00:19:14.010 --> 00:19:15.380
Get all cleaned up.

00:19:16.160 --> 00:19:17.340
Thank you.

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:31.480
<b>Artisan</b>

00:19:25.970 --> 00:19:27.100
Ta-da!

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:32.390
I have a present for you for 
helping us pick corn, Yuki-chan!

00:19:33.410 --> 00:19:34.210
What?

00:19:34.210 --> 00:19:37.640
You don't like wooden smart phone cases? No?

00:19:37.640 --> 00:19:42.110
Okay, this one's more my style, 
but maybe you'd prefer this one?

00:19:43.950 --> 00:19:46.520
Huh? You don't like silicon, either?

00:19:46.520 --> 00:19:49.510
It comes off easily, so she's like, 
"No, don't take it off!"

00:19:49.510 --> 00:19:53.810
Maybe you prefer the "emperor's 
new clothes" style instead?

00:19:55.580 --> 00:19:57.230
<i>This was pointless.</i>

00:19:57.230 --> 00:19:59.010
I can't keep going...

00:19:59.010 --> 00:20:01.770
Come on, don't give up!

00:20:01.770 --> 00:20:05.360
According to the eyewitness report, 
the UMA should be around here...

00:20:05.360 --> 00:20:06.330
Senpai?

00:20:07.380 --> 00:20:09.340
Well, if it isn't Shibaraku.

00:20:09.340 --> 00:20:11.770
You said you couldn't participate 
in today's club activity,

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:14.480
but your curiosity still got the best of you, huh?

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:15.420
No...

00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:16.770
Roar!

00:20:17.380 --> 00:20:20.730
Look, Senpai! I am the UMA!

00:20:20.730 --> 00:20:23.520
You are wrong on a fundamental level!

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:24.240
What?

00:20:26.510 --> 00:20:27.830
The genius girl!

00:20:28.150 --> 00:20:32.440
It must be fate that we met here! Join our club!

00:20:32.440 --> 00:20:32.790
I can't.

00:20:36.450 --> 00:20:37.970
You look nice in a yukata.

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:46.050
How cute.

00:20:46.480 --> 00:20:48.300
I love pork buns.

00:20:48.300 --> 00:20:50.890
<i>I lost to pork buns...</i>

00:20:51.250 --> 00:20:52.790
It's a UFO!

00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:53.850
You're wrong!

00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:56.920
What a drab firework.

00:20:57.390 --> 00:20:59.170
What are you doing, Rurumo?

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:02.280
Here. Eat this.

00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:02.860
Thank you.

00:21:07.280 --> 00:21:08.490
Nothing.

00:21:10.640 --> 00:21:14.540
<i>Nothing happened when those 
two held her hands...</i>

00:21:17.970 --> 00:21:20.740
Isn't my grandmother's corn good?

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:24.340
Thanks a lot for today.

00:21:27.540 --> 00:21:28.900
Shibaraku!

00:21:28.900 --> 00:21:30.330
Coming.

00:21:32.170 --> 00:21:35.340
<i>He patted my head...</i>

00:21:36.330 --> 00:21:37.740
Here we go!

00:23:21.440 --> 00:23:24.590
That's odd. The Shibaki library's missing.

00:23:25.160 --> 00:23:28.420
I also can't find my only chest protector.

00:23:28.420 --> 00:23:30.230
Who is the culprit?

00:23:30.230 --> 00:23:32.610
The next episode is 
"Incident on a Rainy Day."

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:34.970
<b>Next Episode: Incident on a Rainy Day</b>
